<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-tag">Got Questions?</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions & Sizing Guide</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion">
      
      <div class="faq-item active">
        <button class="faq-question">
          <span>What size bed should I get for my dog?</span>
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Check out our simple sizing recommendations based on your dog's weight:</p>
          <table class="sizing-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Size</th>
                <th>Dog Weight</th>
                <th>Example Breeds</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Small (24")</strong></td>
                <td>Up to 25 lbs</td>
                <td>Pugs, Frenchies, Pomeranians, Shih Tzus</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Medium (32")</strong></td>
                <td>25 to 55 lbs</td>
                <td>Corgis, Beagles, Australian Shepherds</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Large (40")</strong></td>
                <td>55 to 85 lbs</td>
                <td>Golden Retrievers, Labs, German Shepherds</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Extra Large (48")</strong></td>
                <td>85+ lbs</td>
                <td>Great Danes, Mastiffs, Multi-Dog Snoozers</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question">
          <span>How do I wash and maintain the Cloud Bed?</span>
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Cleaning is 100% hassle-free! Simply unzip the outer faux-fur cover and machine wash on a gentle cold cycle. Tumble dry on low heat or air dry. The waterproof inner liner protects the orthopedic memory foam from moisture.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question">
          <span>How fast is shipping?</span>
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>All orders are dispatched directly from our <strong>US Warehouse</strong> via USPS Priority Tracked. Delivery takes just <strong>3–5 business days</strong> to your door with real-time tracking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question">
          <span>What is the 30-Night "Tail-Wagging" Guarantee?</span>
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We want your dog to fall in love with their new cloud sleep. If for any reason your dog does not adore the bed within 30 nights, simply email us at <strong>support@pawpawdoo.store</strong> for a 100% refund — no questions asked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sizing & FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}

